    LLM: 'Try to win either many points (79-99 is safe) or very few points (under 29 is safe). Avoid the middle range. Ensure you win at least one trick.\n\nControl when trumps are established by choosing when to void yourself. Win early tricks to control the lead. Preserve 6s (guaranteed exits) and Aces.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track suit distribution to predict when trumps will be established. Coordinate (without explicit communication) to force opponents into the middle. Calculate risk ranges based on cards played.',
